365	     * nephew) and g->left=NULL (near nephew, black). is_black(sib->right) is
366	     * false, so the code skips the rotate_right(sib) conversion at
367	     * rbtree.c:203-208 and goes straight to the terminal recolor+rotate_left.
368	     * Verified against a real build (not hand-simulated only): rb_delete
